73318", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974568_1021100985306651_1737015004059170585_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vS7HGf1k56gQ7kNvwEMZx_M&_nc_oc=AdoMZWImyaIgG9Gb9oKmaEdNZftB-p_slLzrOhzDTdad7TywB5-vbSSb2KXRG3S7nsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2HgsRQz0G21fr-dg4a52BolSIi63oXzpt1oDBjaprYJQ&oe=69F0B236"}, "display_name": "Sing Together", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Sing Together is a VR platform where you can sing with people all over the world while feeling touched at the concert hall.\n\nFeel touched at the concert hall filled with beautiful lighting and hot cheering.\nListen to other people's songs and show off your beautiful songs!\n\nPlay may not be intact with Early Access version.\nIf you need any help, please contact singtogether.official@gmail.com.\n\n- Promotional Video\nFaded Sung by \u110b\u116e\u110c\u116e\u11ab\u1109\u1173\u11bcJWin_Music\nAlan Walker - Fade [NCS Release]\nMusic provided by NoCopyrightSounds.", "short_description": "Sing Together is a VR platform where you can sing with people all over the world while feeling touched at the concert hall.\n\nFeel touched at the concert hall filled with beautiful lighting and hot cheering.\nListen to other people's songs and show off your beautiful songs!\n\nPlay may not be intact with Early Access version."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "hero_cover.png", "id": "1487020784978200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982679_1487020788311533_8849717389397090510_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FsL7zOYi9isQ7kNvwEk0_f4&_nc_oc=AdrvWODEagmCAnROBrBK1A8TTzSHLmAtGAz-jpKXaE1dfIBJVHshSAshUN6Jnl7VynQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3FCkyCnbAJqkO83-I9msyXiRIb16coav_WFABnj9OiDg&oe=69F09ED3"}, {"file_name": "cover_land.png", "id": "1011862452898039", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.